&lt;p&gt;I got to take the project through the complete basic workflow:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Build
  ↓
Test
  ↓
Create production build
  ↓
Deploy
